<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - USG Corp raised to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - USG Corp raised to outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised USG Corp's stock rating to an outperform from neutral on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed on Monday at 30-3/4 on the NYSE.</p>
</text>
